### Walkthrough script for the API (VS Code REST Client / Rider / Visual Studio).
@api = http://localhost:5080/api

### Log in as a claimant
# @name alice
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice" }

### Log in as a handler
# @name hana
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "hana" }

### Claimant reports an incident
# @name submit
POST {{api}}/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Motor",
  "marketCode": "SG",
  "incidentDate": "2026-09-30",
  "incidentLocation": "CTE near Braddell",
  "description": "Rear-ended in stop-start traffic.",
  "claimedAmount": 2500
}

### Handler sees the unassigned queue (oldest first)
GET {{api}}/claims?scope=queue
Authorization: Bearer {{hana.response.body.token}}

### Handler picks it up (If-Match = version they were looking at)
POST {{api}}/claims/{{submit.response.body.id}}/pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{hana.response.body.token}}
If-Match: "1"

### Same request again -> 409 (already picked up) or 412 (stale version)
POST {{api}}/claims/{{submit.response.body.id}}/pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{hana.response.body.token}}
If-Match: "1"

### Request information from the claimant
POST {{api}}/claims/{{submit.response.body.id}}/information-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{hana.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Please upload the dashcam footage." }

### Claimant's view: no reserve, no internal events
GET {{api}}/claims/{{submit.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}

### Claimant's notifications (written by the notifier consumer)
GET {{api}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}

### Team workload (read model fed by events)
GET {{api}}/dashboard/workload
Authorization: Bearer {{hana.response.body.token}}

### Liability exposure by market
GET {{api}}/dashboard/exposure
Authorization: Bearer {{hana.response.body.token}}

### Claimant trying a staff endpoint -> 403
GET {{api}}/dashboard/exposure
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}
